    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">To gift my heart</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The break is coming up and while almost everyone goes home to visit their family, Catra and Adora stay on campus. As their anniversary is coming up, Adora has a surprise planned for Catra. Perfuma offers to help her preparing, even arranges Scorpia to help (indirectly).&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
